url: https://github.com/szpajder/dumphfdl
version: v1.7.0
pkgrev: 1

Source tarball fetched as:
  https://github.com/szpajder/dumphfdl/archive/refs/tags/<version>.tar.gz
Debian packaging adapted from upstream master debian/ dir (commit 7b78d5b,
Phil Karn) with Build-Depends/Depends fixed (see PROVENANCE.md).
Build requires libacars2 + libacars2-dev debs in DEP_DEBS_DIR (build
libacars first; build-thirdparty-deb.sh installs them into the chroot).
Bump `version:` to move upstream; bump `pkgrev:` for packaging-only changes.
